      "connector-runner e2e 2026-11-26 (gettakaro/connectors#1005): real vanilla Valheim PC client (Steam, Version 1.0.30 n-42) on this exact pin (server files sha256-checked against the takaro-maint install of this target, BepInExPack 5.4.2351), plugin built from this branch through hosted Takaro MCP - player-connected a3c2b578-2ca8-4b00-9c85-50cfdd7eba07, chat-message 501a2136-f500-4dbf-8c18-57bd7aa4f654, command-executed @ping 8ba0dde5-6fbb-46d3-b98d-6099ad6ee2b8, player-death 5a601a8f-bcdb-46a9-aeb7-93f2be2f8153, entity-killed 588e8c1f-e31b-404a-a279-5daeb8946078 (Boar with Club), player-disconnected 66251b96-8b35-4141-97f7-e5890b5fdcea; testReachability, getPlayers, sendMessage (global, whisper with senderNameOverride), executeConsoleCommand (allowlisted help, denial of a non-allowlisted command, allowlisted kick), teleportPlayer, giveItem, kickPlayer, banPlayer/listBans/unbanPlayer (banned rejoin refused, rejoin after unban) and shutdown seen in the client; Discord chat bridge game-to-Discord and Discord-to-game relays, connect/disconnect posts and no echo"
    ],
    "notes": "Exact Steam pin of the public head at declaration time (buildid 26870897, Valheim 1.0.30 network version 42, updated 2026-11-25). Repins the previous 1.0.21/26266951 target after Valve moved the public branch (#1005); depot 896661 manifest 4273662745691255082. The connector is a dedicated-server plugin. An optional graphical-client inventory mod (role client-companion) exists; deploy only parks its zip in takaro-companion/. Player-driven events (chat, deaths, kills), server chat and the optional inventory mod need a connected game client and are NOT covered by takaro-maint verify, which boots a dedicated server with no client. Runtime CI onboarding is a separate issue."
  },
